<title>UK: Banco Inter Atlantico prices $125 million Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Banco Inter Atlantico prices $125 million Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced</p>
<p>earlier by joint lead managers Credit Agricole Indosuez and</p>
<p>Credit Agricole, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO INTER ATLANTICO SA</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON     8.25	MATURITY	.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.8696   PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    99.8696   SPREAD	+215 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) *	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
